There are muliple generations of OLPC laptops, x86 ones based on Geode, VIA
and ARM based with Marvell Armada. All of boot with OpenFirmware and share
some peripherals.

This patch adds the common files.

Signed-off-by: Lubomir Rintel <lkundrak@v3.sk>
